{"4502680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monsters Awaiting Parcels", "steam_appid": 4502680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/8f302df6c07b9396ab704811aa88cc26.avif?t=1784271981\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras_big/8f302df6c07b9396ab704811aa88cc26.webp?t=1784271981 width=1560 height=124 /></span>The world has long since stopped being a familiar place. Creatures from every corner of the universe now live among us. And despite all their differences, they share one very common habit: <strong>ORDERING PARCELS. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AT YOUR PICKUP POINT, YOU CAN MEET ABSOLUTELY ANYONE =)))</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/e12974117ad9ca5f2c6300e3b14ce244.poster.avif?t=1784271981\" width=1170 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/e12974117ad9ca5f2c6300e3b14ce244.webm?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/e12974117ad9ca5f2c6300e3b14ce244.mp4?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/93d844a4ae2a51d0f812216dde996479.poster.avif?t=1784271981\" width=1170 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/93d844a4ae2a51d0f812216dde996479.webm?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/93d844a4ae2a51d0f812216dde996479.mp4?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The counter is never empty! Monsters show up with all kinds of plans: to pick up a parcel, to send one, or… maybe to swipe someone else’s. Keep your eyes peeled!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Match the photo, name, and document number carefully. If anything looks fishy, peek into the <strong>Registry of Creatures</strong> — your trusty guide to all the weird and quirky monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/947178c50db14383bdabe8718603b1dc.poster.avif?t=1784271981\" width=1114 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/947178c50db14383bdabe8718603b1dc.webm?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/947178c50db14383bdabe8718603b1dc.mp4?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/7790223d10863a6f756376073bb2b989.poster.avif?t=1784271981\" width=1170 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/7790223d10863a6f756376073bb2b989.webm?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/7790223d10863a6f756376073bb2b989.mp4?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>QR Codes &amp; Parcel Hunting</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan the QR code and verify the shipment number, recipient’s name, and delivery status. Find the right box in the warehouse among dozens of others. One mistake, and someone might walk away with the wrong parcel!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Payment &amp; Sending Parcels</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some clients come to pick up parcels, others to send them—register the shipment, collect payment if needed, and generate a new QR code.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Spotting Rule-Breakers &amp; Handing Out Orders</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricksters might try to grab someone else’s parcel or cheat the system. Your job is to catch them in time. If everything matches — QR code, ID, parcel, and payment — you can hand over the shipment to its rightful owner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/e509fa1e3d2ed7ddee22f183264c4445.poster.avif?t=1784271981\" width=1170 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/e509fa1e3d2ed7ddee22f183264c4445.webm?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/e509fa1e3d2ed7ddee22f183264c4445.mp4?t=1784271981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>But one mistake, and someone else’s box could end up in the wrong hands… or paws. Stay sharp at your new workplace!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502680/extras/8f302df6c07b9396ab704811aa88cc26.avif?t=1784271981\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamsta